      "question_text": "20 When a saucepan of water is heated from below, convection currents form and transfer heat through the liquid. Here are three statements about the water as it is heated: 1 The mass of a fixed volume of the water increases. 2 The density of a fixed mass of the water decreases. 3 The volume of a fixed mass of the water increases. Which of these statements help(s) to explain how convection currents are formed?",
